      title:'From AI research to a content package',
      moment_line:'You did deep research in Perplexity or ChatGPT and got a block of findings. Now you need to turn it into content you can publish, not just read.',
      teach_block:`When I paste you research findings from Perplexity or another AI tool and tell you where it is headed:
1. Distill the core insight and the two or three most important points.
2. Produce a distribution package in my voice: a LinkedIn post opening with the insight, a short WhatsApp message for quick sharing, and a paragraph for an email or newsletter.
3. Stay fully faithful to the facts from the research. Do not add a figure or a source that did not appear. Anything that sounds important but is not backed up, flag for me.
4. Present the three versions one below the other with the channel name above each.
5. After approval, suggest a posting time for each channel, and save the package to the library tagged with the topic.
If the research is long, tell me first in one sentence the angle you chose, so I can steer before you write.`,
